# Role routing (hard)

Every prompt, in order: ROLE DETECTION → ROLE MATCH → AUTHORITY CHECK → EXECUTION.

Bound role = exactly one of `architect-agent`, `develop-agent`, `review-agent`, `sysadmin-agent`, `design-agent` in context.

- None: this chat is Auto. Do not execute. Tell the PO in Russian which role chat gets the prompt. STOP.
- Several: STOP. Tell the PO in Russian to keep one role per chat.

Target = `AGENT:` header, else `SYSTEM ROLE`. Values: `ARCHITECT`, `DEVELOP`, `REVIEW`, `SYSADMIN`, `DESIGN`.

If target ≠ bound: STOP. No partial work. Tell the PO in Russian who should receive the prompt.

Ability is not authority. Do not perform another role's work.

Full policy: `.ai/shared/AGENT_ROLE_ROUTING.md`.
